yogabook-camera (0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First public early release of the standalone two-camera daemon and package.
  * Preserve the daemon from local development build 1.1.7 without introducing
    a new camera algorithm or claiming final image-quality acceptance.
  * Include PipeWire, WirePlumber, systemd user-service and Snapshot integration.
  * Document pinned kernel prerequisites and include the camera-only ACPI
    patcher for a user-supplied stock DSDT; do not redistribute firmware or AML.
  * Include the GPLv2 license and correct MIT attribution and license text for
    the companion upstream PipeWire colourimetry backport.
  * Omit the unrelated legacy plugin and device-specific hardware-lab scripts.

